# rmt_storage talks to the remoteproc shared memory entry and needs a
# few capabilities of its own.
#
# sys_admin is needed for ioprio_set().  CAF grants it in the legacy
# policy for the older (non-"common") HALs this device uses:
#   device/qcom/sepolicy/legacy-common/rmt_storage.te:1
#     allow rmt_storage self:capability sys_admin;
# The "common" policy (device/qcom/sepolicy/common/rmt_storage.te:16)
# replaces it with a narrower set that does not work here.
allow rmt_storage self:capability {dac_override net_raw sys_admin};
